IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. THRUDEMO.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-T PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    PERFORM STEP-A THRU STEP-C.
    DISPLAY "total=" WS-T.
    PERFORM STEP-A THRU STEP-B 2 TIMES.
    DISPLAY "total2=" WS-T.
    STOP RUN.

STEP-A.
    ADD 1 TO WS-T.
    DISPLAY "A".

STEP-B.
    ADD 10 TO WS-T.
    DISPLAY "B".

STEP-C.
    ADD 100 TO WS-T.
    DISPLAY "C".
